@en The coffee machine stands next to the fridge.
@distractor-en oven
@distractor-en dishwasher
@distractor-lu Uewen
@distractor-lu Spullmaschinn

@sentence
@lu D'Kaffismillen steet niewent der Kaffismaschinn.
@en The coffee grinder stands beside the coffee machine.
@distractor-en cooker
@distractor-en mirror
@distractor-lu Kachmaschinn
@distractor-lu Spigel

@sentence
@lu Nieft dem Bett steet en Nuetsdësch.
@en A bedside table stands beside the bed.
@distractor-en wardrobe
@distractor-en carpet
@distractor-lu Kleederschaf
@distractor-lu Teppech

@sentence
