# --- @fill: articles reveal static dative and movement accusative -------------
# The paired frames keep the noun and changing preposition visible, so the article
# alone must signal the case. Three distractors per direction leave a safe margin.

@fill
@lu D'Fotell steet op [der] Terrass.
@en [The armchair] stands on the terrace.
@distractor-lu d'
@distractor-lu dem
@distractor-lu den
@distractor-en A sofa
@distractor-en The table
@distractor-en The mirror

@fill
